── SYNTAX ERROR ─────────────────────── E0100_optional_chaining.lt:3:38  [E0100]

Stilt reads a field through an `Option` with `.`, without `?`:

  3 │ fn boss_name(u: User) -> str { u.boss?.name ?? "none" }
    │                                      ^

A field read through an `Option` is an `Option` of the field, `None` when the
value is missing.

To fix it, write `.` and `else`:

  3 │ fn boss_name(u: User) -> str { u.boss.name else "none" }
    │                                            ~~~~
